"""Phase 9 diagnostics — original CIA items only (no ASQ exam questions, no Body of Knowledge text). Every item allows
"I don't know" through its assessment.

READINESS — quality readiness diagnostic (ASM-READY-Q-001), 12 items across quality foundations, tools, problem solving,
            auditing, cost and suppliers.
ROUTE     — extra items per route diagnostic; the builder adds the route courses' lesson checks.
CMQOE     — CMQ/OE Center diagnostic (ASM-CMQOE-DIAG): two items per major Body of Knowledge area, tagged with the area index so the
            Center can show weak areas. Area NAMES only are used (from the official BoK), never its text.
The Phase 5 demo item Q-QMS-001 keeps its id and subjective type; its topic is re-expressed as the auto-scored twin Q-Q-RD-03.
Author: مدثر سلامه."""
from lib9 import T, opt, question

D = "diagnostic"


def q(qid, comp, prompt, options, correct, expl, **kw):
    kw.setdefault("fmt", D)
    return question(qid, comp, prompt, options, correct, expl, **kw)


